OL,3,GNEWSABarlinnie visitors unable to use
OL,4,Atoilets as water supply problems
OL,5,Acontinue
OL,6,
OL,7,FVisitors to Barlinnie prison have been
OL,8,Funable to use the toilets as work
OL,9,Fcontinues to resolve water supply
OL,10,Fissues at Scotland's largest jail.
OL,12,FSome inmates at two halls in Barlinnie
OL,13,Fin Glasgow first experienced problems
OL,14,Fon Thursday night and had no access to
OL,15,Fbottled water.
OL,17,FOn Friday the Scottish Prison Service
OL,18,F(SPS) said the issue was proving more
OL,19,Fdifficult to fully resolve and staff
OL,20,Fwould continue to support people
OL,21,Faffected.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
