OL,3,GNEWSABarlinnie visitors unable to use
OL,4,Atoilets as water supply problems
OL,5,Acontinue
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut the problems have continued into
OL,8,Fthe weekend and one woman, who supports
OL,9,Fa prisoner, told BBC Scotland News that
OL,10,Flaundry was mounting up.
